        minMoodPercent: 0
        minTrust: 0
        allowedPeriods: 
    npcFollowUpText: 
    isConversationEnd: 0
    isTerminal: 0
  - nodeId: node_1_bestseller
    fallbackLine: Nasi goreng. Dari dulu sampai sekarang. Ada pelanggan saya- tiap
      pagi mesen ini, udah bertahun-tahun. Katanya kalau ga sarapan nasi goreng sini,
      harinya ga bener.
    variationPool: []
    choices:
    - choiceText: Iya, pesen itu.
      nextNodeId: node_end_order
      consequence:
        energyDelta: 0
        moodDelta: 0
        calorieDelta: 0
        trustDelta: 0
        trackerAction: 4
      gate:
        useGate: 0
        minEnergyPercent: 0
        minMoodPercent: 0
        minTrust: 0
        allowedPeriods: 
    - choiceText: Ntar dulu, lihat-lihat dulu.
      nextNodeId: node_2_browse
      consequence:
        energyDelta: 0
        moodDelta: 0
        calorieDelta: 0
        trustDelta: 0
        trackerAction: 4
      gate:
        useGate: 0
        minEnergyPercent: 0
        minMoodPercent: 0
        minTrust: 0
        allowedPeriods: 
    npcFollowUpText: Entah karena emang enak, atau udah jadi ritual. Mau coba?
    isConversationEnd: 0
    isTerminal: 0
  - nodeId: node_1_cheap
    fallbackLine: Haha, jujur ya. Suka yang jujur. Pisang goreng sama teh manis paling
      terjangkau. Tapi kalau mau yang ngenyangkin, nasi sama tempe lebih worth it
      dikit.
    variationPool: []
    choices:
    - choiceText: Pesen nasi tempe.
      nextNodeId: node_end_order
      consequence:
        energyDelta: 0
        moodDelta: 0
        calorieDelta: 0
        trustDelta: 0
        trackerAction: 4
      gate:
        useGate: 0
        minEnergyPercent: 0
        minMoodPercent: 0
        minTrust: 0
        allowedPeriods: 
    - choiceText: Pisang goreng aja dulu.
      nextNodeId: node_end_order
      consequence:
        energyDelta: 0
        moodDelta: 0
        calorieDelta: 0
        trustDelta: 0
        trackerAction: 4
      gate:
        useGate: 0
        minEnergyPercent: 0
        minMoodPercent: 0
        minTrust: 0
        allowedPeriods: 
    npcFollowUpText: Banyak yang langganan combo itu. Murah, cukup buat kerja setengah
      hari.
    isConversationEnd: 0
    isTerminal: 0
  - nodeId: node_1_rec
    fallbackLine: Kalau aku yang milih... gado-gado. Bukan yang paling rame dipesan,
      tapi yang paling sering bikin orang kaget enak. Bahan-bahannya fresh, aku ga
      kompromi soal itu.
    variationPool: []
    choices:
    - choiceText: Oke, pesen gado-gado.
      nextNodeId: node_end_order
      consequence:
        energyDelta: 0
        moodDelta: 0
        calorieDelta: 0
        trustDelta: 0
        trackerAction: 4
